# Patch for CVE-2026-73566 / GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m
# Uncontrolled recursion in mapHas/filesFilter: cap walk at 100 path segments
# so a crafted GNU-L / PAX long-path cannot stack-overflow the process.
#
# Upstream fix: https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/commit/631ae59121bf8fc8a22bbae35f074cb9b789cd4a
# (node-tar v7.5.21 — "list: prevent unbounded recursion")
#
# Affected version: tar@6.2.1
# Backport of the v7 src/list.ts MAX=100 cap onto CommonJS lib/list.js.
#
--- a/lib/list.js
